From 9477432426a054a5e9d42267827385d4d2762009 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lauri Ojansivu <x@xet7.org>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 22:32:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [TRANSLATION] Add Finnish (fi-FI) to the NTSTATUS message
 table

Problem: The 693 NTSTATUS texts - the access violation, missing DLL and
bad image dialogs among them - had no Finnish.

Why: Applications and the system show them to the user.

How: Add Finnish=0x40B and a Finnish block to every message of
ntstatus.mc, with the same printf (%hs, %08lx, %wZ) and %1 inserts as the
English. A message whose text is its own symbolic name (STATUS_WAIT_0)
stays so. The table compiles with windmc.
---
 sdk/include/reactos/mc/ntstatus.mc | 2267 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 2266 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/sdk/include/reactos/mc/ntstatus.mc b/sdk/include/reactos/mc/ntstatus.mc
index d11a65ca9f6..76b1efbe2d6 100644
--- a/sdk/include/reactos/mc/ntstatus.mc
+++ b/sdk/include/reactos/mc/ntstatus.mc
@@ -18,7 +18,8 @@ Cluster=0x13:FACILITY_CLUSTER_ERROR_CODE
 ACPI=0x14:FACILITY_ACPI_ERROR_CODE
 SXS=0x15:FACILITY_SXS_ERROR_CODE
 )
-LanguageNames=(English=0x409:MSG00409)
+LanguageNames=(English=0x409:MSG00409
+               Finnish=0x40B:MSG0040B)
 
 MessageId=0x00
 Severity=Success
@@ -27,6 +28,9 @@ SymbolicName=STATUS_WAIT_0
 Language=English
 STATUS_WAIT_0
 .
+Language=Finnish
+STATUS_WAIT_0
+.
 
 MessageId=0x01
 Severity=Success
@@ -35,6 +39,9 @@ SymbolicName=STATUS_WAIT_1
 Language=English
 STATUS_WAIT_1
 .
+Language=Finnish
+STATUS_WAIT_1
+.
 
 MessageId=0x02
 Severity=Success
@@ -43,6 +50,9 @@ SymbolicName=STATUS_WAIT_2
 Language=English
 STATUS_WAIT_2
 .
+Language=Finnish
+STATUS_WAIT_2
+.
 
 MessageId=0x03
 Severity=Success
